Package: fluid-speech-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libasound2
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/fluid-speech-rs
Description: Fluid Speech Mini speech-to-text CLI and dictation daemon (candle)
 fluid-speech transcribes audio files or the microphone with Fluid Speech
 Mini (a palettised Parakeet TDT 0.6B), natively on candle. fluid-dictate is
 a push-to-talk dictation daemon (Linux and macOS). The model (327 MB) is
 downloaded from Hugging Face on first use into ~/.cache/fluid-speech-rs, or
 taken from --model.
